   },
   {
    "row": 3,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "We note that parameterizing weight updates via synthetic data generation rather than directly predict-",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "028157e2b9f97b95185c00259e6e87269b78b5821976a51a5b1828c87228f6eb"
   },
   {
    "row": 4,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "ing LoRA weights has several advantages: (1) generated data can be reused for CPT or applied to",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "fe00573cb7bcd7732e0ebeef764d04e0ab49c68a46ef81ccac00ce43c851d0f8"
   },
   {
    "row": 5,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "arbitrary base models, (2) models can leverage reasoning and restructuring as document scale and",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "1df93e60d56bc9acbdfbff7d59af46a6d23c00365da539714c0b2a5d5cfb9e29"
   },
   {
    "row": 6,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "complexity grow, and (3) the framework is not restricted to LoRA finetuning, allowing for many",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "6981ab6c966e3a6d9d072526659315ec16d018ed91c1f6b6ef55e3bf88cd9a2a"
   },
   {
    "row": 7,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "different update types, including those arising from environment or user interactions. By contrast,",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "758dbd4115a89b443a04284eca47fe52e47ac8f098912c9c5367fc08736ae37e"
   },
   {
    "row": 8,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "it is unclear how hypernetwork-based approaches would scale to such settings, while next-token",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "5189812f90bde17f481ce6321528bf6e535781411166fdfc18b4e53ee5ce5da6"
   },
   {
    "row": 9,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 4,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "prediction on generated data naturally exploits a model's in-context learning capabilities.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "6edd95f7cc9ff1bab7b9c8c608e77ca6cb12e73d4b5796fde0b94e79a91b7cce"
   }
  ],
  "source_digest": "f889b2862dfc6197e6146f1323b5d4cafc7d092e3ce81639fb160e4e5220b9d4",
  "missingness": null
 },
